This code sets up a Flask application that communicates with a SCPI-compatible instrument over a serial port, manages an in-memory data store, and provides various routes to interact with the data store. It includes error handling for serial port operations and input parsing, and ensures the serial port is closed on every exit path. The application binds to 0.0.0.0, allowing it to be accessed from any network interface on the Raspberry Pi.

